## [AWS Lifecycle changes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/latest/gr/service-lifecycle.md)

- [Services in Maintenance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/latest/gr/maintenance_services.md): Customers can't on-board to services and features in the maintenance stage.
- [Services in Sunset](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/latest/gr/sunset_services.md): Customers already using services and features in the sunset stage should plan to migrate to alternatives as recommended in the product pages and documentation.
- [Services in Full Shutdown](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/latest/gr/full_shutdown_services.md): Full shutdown represents the final stage in the lifecycle of a service or feature.


